msgid "This task package installs the Stereo OS developer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: the development files of the edition's stereo stack at the edition's versions (stereo-declare, stereo-layer, gl-stereo, Mesa, KWin, Qt and the Wayland protocols), Debian packaging tools, the stereo proof rig and the virtual display benches, the tools KDE's CI needs locally, and the edition's maintainer skills for humans and local or hosted AI partners; it brings the developer task."
msgstr "This task package installs the Stereo OS developer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: the development files of the edition's stereo stack at the edition's versions (stereo-declare, stereo-layer, gl-stereo, Mesa, KWin, Qt and the Wayland protocols), Debian packaging tools, the stereo proof rig and the virtual display benches, the tools KDE's CI needs locally, and the edition's maintainer skills for humans and local or hosted AI partners; it brings the developer task."

msgid "This task package installs the developer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: KDE's development tools first (KDevelop, Kate and the KDE SDK, the Qt 6 and KDE Frameworks development files, Qt Creator), compilers, debuggers and build systems for C, C++, Rust, Go, Python, Java and the other languages Debian carries, version control, containers and virtual machines, graphics and GPU debugging, the game engines and game libraries."
msgstr "This task package installs the developer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: KDE's development tools first (KDevelop, Kate and the KDE SDK, the Qt 6 and KDE Frameworks development files, Qt Creator), compilers, debuggers and build systems for C, C++, Rust, Go, Python, Java and the other languages Debian carries, version control, containers and virtual machines, graphics and GPU debugging, the game engines and game libraries."

