msgid "The stereo 3D edition of SparkyLinux, based on Debian."
msgstr "The stereo 3D edition of SparkyLinux, based on Debian."

msgid "This task package installs the designer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: drawing, painting, photo and 3D modelling programs, colour management."
msgstr "This task package installs the designer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: drawing, painting, photo and 3D modelling programs, colour management."

msgid "This task package installs the electrical and automation engineer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: circuits and PCBs, electrical diagrams, circuit simulation, logic analysers and serial tools, FPGAs, PLC programming, SCADA and HMI, industrial protocols and power systems."
msgstr "This task package installs the electrical and automation engineer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: circuits and PCBs, electrical diagrams, circuit simulation, logic analysers and serial tools, FPGAs, PLC programming, SCADA and HMI, industrial protocols and power systems."

msgid "This task package installs the gamer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: games, Steam, the stereo Lutris build, the game runtimes and the controllers."
msgstr "This task package installs the gamer programs of Sparky Stereo OS: games, Steam, the stereo Lutris build, the game runtimes and the controllers."

msgid "This task package installs the maker programs of Sparky Stereo OS: 3D printing: modelling, mesh checking and repair, slicing, printer control, 3D scanning and electronics."
msgstr "This task package installs the maker programs of Sparky Stereo OS: 3D printing: modelling, mesh checking and repair, slicing, printer control, 3D scanning and electronics."

msgid "This task package installs the musician programs of Sparky Stereo OS: audio production: plugins, synthesizers, routing and recording."
msgstr "This task package installs the musician programs of Sparky Stereo OS: audio production: plugins, synthesizers, routing and recording."

msgid "This task package installs the scientist programs of Sparky Stereo OS: science and engineering: mathematics, chemistry, maps, CAD, GIS and plotting. Only the programs that show stereo 3D on Sparky Stereo OS today; task-sparky-scientist installs the others."
msgstr "This task package installs the scientist programs of Sparky Stereo OS: science and engineering: mathematics, chemistry, maps, CAD, GIS and plotting. Only the programs that show stereo 3D on Sparky Stereo OS today; task-sparky-scientist installs the others."

msgid "This task package installs the scientist programs of SparkyOS that have no stereo 3D version yet: science and engineering: mathematics, chemistry, maps, CAD, GIS and plotting. Install it together with task-sparky-stereo-scientist; it never replaces our stereo builds."
msgstr "This task package installs the scientist programs of SparkyOS that have no stereo 3D version yet: science and engineering: mathematics, chemistry, maps, CAD, GIS and plotting. Install it together with task-sparky-stereo-scientist; it never replaces our stereo builds."

msgid "This task package installs the simulator pilot and driver programs of Sparky Stereo OS: flight and racing simulators and the tools for their rigs."
msgstr "This task package installs the simulator pilot and driver programs of Sparky Stereo OS: flight and racing simulators and the tools for their rigs."

msgid "This task package installs the student programs of Sparky Stereo OS: education: the KDE Edu programs and GCompris. Only the programs that show stereo 3D on Sparky Stereo OS today; task-sparky-student installs the others."
msgstr "This task package installs the student programs of Sparky Stereo OS: education: the KDE Edu programs and GCompris. Only the programs that show stereo 3D on Sparky Stereo OS today; task-sparky-student installs the others."

msgid "This task package installs the student programs of SparkyOS that have no stereo 3D version yet: education: the KDE Edu programs and GCompris. Install it together with task-sparky-stereo-student; it never replaces our stereo builds."
msgstr "This task package installs the student programs of SparkyOS that have no stereo 3D version yet: education: the KDE Edu programs and GCompris. Install it together with task-sparky-stereo-student; it never replaces our stereo builds."

msgid "This task package installs the video creator programs of Sparky Stereo OS: video editing, streaming, encoding and subtitling."
msgstr "This task package installs the video creator programs of Sparky Stereo OS: video editing, streaming, encoding and subtitling."
